{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6b760d9a8eeea21fa60c52fc927aec66208bbb284b1044189051e672f0ab8b5a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b571384ea64d5e5fbd02c1b8db1a8f7a9257a865a2b1bbb216c1b21f0a5aa805",
      "text": "综合大家的意见，最后还是聚餐呢。\n定在生日当天可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e17dc448f2fce22602003e4cdf36b473b8440dcbbbeeeedc972908d49b7de0b4",
      "text": "那天的话，大家正好都休息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47c7236d7b67e216af4e2540e6742462acb73a9d519cb48e01080ff1bccfb298",
      "text": "雨彦先生的生日是万圣节当天对吧～。\n避开可能会很拥挤的晚餐，改成午餐怎么样～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd429e38ec99fb93caccd7297f7fdaafba48ca368a76df3685b4b76ebb0eac4f",
      "text": "赞成！我知道一家能吃到美味海鲜的店，\n定在那里怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f36a0991213fee1b37a2822cfb4db2d671e0dd067712a4493a92cce03ebe8152",
      "text": "西班牙风味的马赛鱼汤萨苏埃拉，\n堪称一绝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf7e9761b021511aa450a78639aff3d389fde5272d4c569eb2cc41dcab9579a",
      "text": "这个时节的话，\n应该是以当季的鱿鱼和大虾为主。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89e8996357b7902234dba9f63552f3ca6f01b4b2a260a63ac46292ec67388da8",
      "text": "好呀！就定在那里吧。\n克里斯先生推荐的店铺肯定不会错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb3efdd0b6f986569437a7bc4349f96a385d90f6a22d7d526d024846dbde1496",
      "text": "下次碰头会结束之后，\n跟雨彦先生提提看吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000062:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6431d35ecc91488152481fb23fe0f1886db5adeb6d65c1ebe08f33668df273c",
      "text": "另一次碰头会结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66952a9f12282a17bdd7a406897275ed937ffebbfb8f29264aae51edd386a78c",
      "text": "雨彦，稍微打扰一下可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a83fa76b503bf4b4df21827052cca053030f4f52bd9998bf0b728cb3fa3e1fe",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了，古论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c15aa5ba18a61e307ce01d841897a43c32f23e317ab87966ceb347e10ceac23e",
      "text": "雨彦生日那天，\n在场的大家一起去吃午饭怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cb7e8ff2e259ecc8c503c1a3d6d92e266bbfc7faae589a7635a4f618b21043",
      "text": "虽说只是小小的聚餐，\n但想为你庆祝一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d37c757358de596e679226d9966ef8e1c3dbf5a4037f312933899b6cb7ed5db4",
      "text": "啊啊，这样啊。今年也能有人替我庆祝生日，\n真是感激不尽。我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
